### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Crear conductor sin empresa
POST http://localhost:4000/api/conductores HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Martinez",
  "description": "Conductor experimentado",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Crear conductor con empresa valida
POST http://localhost:4000/api/conductores HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Gomez",
  "description": "Conductora turno nocturno",
  "company_id": 1,
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Crear conductor con empresa inexistente (404)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/conductores HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luis Torres",
  "company_id": 9999,
  "status": "active"
}
